=2 Walkthrough
* Complete the quest {q:The Road to Aht Urhgan|The Road to Aht Urhgan|The Road to Aht Urhgan}.
* Head to {z:Mhaura} and take the boat to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}.
** If you choose to pay 500,000 gil you do not need to take the boat to start the mission.
** You no longer need to take the boat at all as the {p:Unity Warp} for {z:Wajaom Woodlands} (lv. 125) will take you to a good location to make a brief trek on foot.
*** The survival guide for {z:Aydeewa Subterrane} is just inside where it warps you.
*** This becomes available as soon as you get the {k:Boarding permit}, along with the warp to {z:Mount Zhayolm}.
* Approach {p:Naja Salaheem} at (I-10) to receive the {@k} {k:Supplies package}.
** She is located inside the building upstairs in the northeast corner of the grid square.
* If this is your first time to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, be sure to pick up the Home Point crystal (to make future travel easier).
** There is a residential zone pretty close to where you exit the ferry dock. There is a Home Point crystal there.

